@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@bobId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@commentBobId = 30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@commentInternalId = 30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

### Alice login; REST Client reads process environment (пароль у файл не записується)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "alice", "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}" }

### Own details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}
Accept: application/json

### Foreign details with the same Alice cookie (IDOR/BOLA PoC)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}
Accept: application/json

### Foreign child resource: comment of Bob's incident
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/{{commentBobId}}
Accept: application/json

### Internal comment on Alice's own incident (Reporter must not see it)
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/{{commentInternalId}}
Accept: application/json

### Vertical: Reporter tries privileged triage
POST {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}/triage

### Bob login changes current identity
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "bob", "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}" }

### Own details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}
Accept: application/json

### Morgan login; Analyst read
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "morgan", "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}" }

### Permitted Analyst read (A-03R)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}
Accept: application/json
